  "prompt": "这个项目的输入框插件提供哪些公开定制能力？修改输入框外观是否需要接管源码？只查看，不要修改。",
  "projectRoot": "/private/var/folders/bl/0_1mpzdj25sf3c0vh6qmc3qc0000gn/T/pytest-of-yifei/pytest-871/test_real_creator_task_plugin_0/host-plugin_question",
